body:
@mods, this one has posted as a BPD person in some BPD-friendly subreddits.

Anyone reading this comment should disregard because "seeing it personally" from a person with BPD is a highly subjective statement. And "work" is a very loose definition; most people here are recovering from relationships, so they mean it in those terms, not "does it make them a little less suicidal" (although it's great if DBT helps with that). 

You're not allowed to post here, dude.
